Sealed Interface vs Sealed Class

| Feature               | Sealed Class        | Sealed Interface         |
| --------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |
| Purpose               | Restrict subclasses | Restrict implementations |
| Keyword               | extends             | implements               |
| Can have constructors | Yes                 | No                       |
| Multiple inheritance  | No                  | Yes (interfaces)         |

